(947, 37, 8882, 5197, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, -42000, 0, 0, 16, 0, 0, 0, 980, 0.0, 0.0, 5, 5, 'Thrallmar', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 16712190, 'The expedition sent through the Dark Portal by Thrall has built a stronghold in Hellfire Peninsula.  Thrallmar serves as a base of operations for much of the Horde\'s activities in Outland.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 16712190),
